    { "type": "text", "id": "clock_note_t", "x": 52, "y": 688, "width": 1656, "height": 80, "text": "The amber and green deadlines are FLOORS, not ceilings: claim::advance_phase (claim.move:320), jury::reveal_vote (jury.move:527) and\nsettlement::finalize_claim (settlement.move:116) all assert now > deadline. So a claim on the default ladder takes at least 45 minutes even when\nall five jurors answer in the first minute, and 90 minutes with a second round. Only the CLI and scripts pass shorter ladders; claim.move only\nrequires the values to be strictly increasing within 30 days. The localnet ladder used by tests is minutes-scale for the same reason.", "originalText": "The amber and green deadlines are FLOORS, not ceilings: claim::advance_phase (claim.move:320), jury::reveal_vote (jury.move:527) and\nsettlement::finalize_claim (settlement.move:116) all assert now > deadline. So a claim on the default ladder takes at least 45 minutes even when\nall five jurors answer in the first minute, and 90 minutes with a second round. Only the CLI and scripts pass shorter ladders; claim.move only\nrequires the values to be strictly increasing within 30 days. The localnet ladder used by tests is minutes-scale for the same reason.", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "middle", "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 160071, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 160072, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "clock_note", "lineHeight": 1.25 },

    { "type": "text", "id": "parity", "x": 40, "y": 800, "width": 1680, "height": 36, "text": "Cross-language pinning: six parity vectors (tests/integration/parity.test.ts + move/openverdict/tests/parity_tests.move) fix the vote commitment byte-for-byte\nacross TypeScript and Move. The manifest hash, evidence root and run hash are computed in TypeScript only; Move stores and compares them as opaque bytes.", "originalText": "Cross-language pinning: six parity vectors (tests/integration/parity.test.ts + move/openverdict/tests/parity_tests.move) fix the vote commitment byte-for-byte\nacross TypeScript and Move. The manifest hash, evidence root and run hash are computed in TypeScript only; Move stores and compares them as opaque bytes.", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#64748b", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 160073, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 160074, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25 }
